//             // PROTECTIVE LEGS ON THE SAME BAR AS THE ENTRY. Gating them on
//             // `position_size != 0` instead would leave the position NAKED for
//             // the whole fill bar - and that bar is the one most likely to run
//             // against a fresh absorption entry, so the backtest would be
//             // OPTIMISTIC exactly where it must not be. The emulator explicitly
//             // supports strategy.exit against a not-yet-filled from_entry.
